# social-automation backend

- CF carousel entrypoints: `run-carousel-and-publish`, `generate-carousel-pipeline`.
- NLP: `app/services/plain_english.py` — force_fix for carousels.
- Images: FLUX schnell uses `steps` only; prefer FLUX.2 klein-4b for enhance.
- `MediaAsset.source` is `String(20)` — keep source labels short.
- LinkedIn org posts: `_linkedin_author_urn` when `account_type == organization`.
- After changing `publishing.py` or Celery tasks: remind to restart `social-worker`.
- Follow skill `cloudless-carousel-pipeline` for pipeline changes.
